# Generated CIGALE→DSPS reproduction artifact (bc03_from_cigale.h5, ~400 MB;
# built on demand by reproduction/cigale/_drivers/cigale_ssp_to_dsps.py).
# The path itself is ignored so a stray `data` symlink can't be committed
# again (a self-referential symlink slipped in via #1035).
reproduction/cigale/_drivers/data
data/*.h5
# ── The two SSP grids the gallery needs, committed on purpose (#1146) ──
# CI could not execute a single example without these, so a broken example
# shipped next to a stale figure (see tools/run_gallery_examples.py). The wNE
# default is what `tengri.load_ssp()` resolves to and is NOT downloadable
# (404 on the SSP host), so it has to live here. The bare-stellar grid IS
# downloadable, but at 64 MB it is committed by explicit decision rather than
# fetched-and-cached: it makes a fresh clone — and CI — work with no network.
# This is a deliberate exception to the "<10 MB gets committed" rule.
!data/ssp_prsc_miles_chabrier_wNE_logGasU-3.0_logGasZ0.0.h5
!data/fsps_prsc_miles_chabrier.h5
# RELAGN disc grid (26 MB). `examples/agn/plot_agn_disc_compare.py` plots it, and
# it CANNOT be rebuilt in CI: scripts/build_relagn_disc_grid.py needs a conda env
# with XSPEC. Without it that example raised FileNotFoundError for every user who
# does not have XSPEC — which is everyone — while its committed figure showed the
# curve anyway.
!data/relagn_disc_grid.h5
!data/skirtor_templates_v3.h5
!data/nthcomp_templates.h5
!data/nenkova08_torus_grid.h5
# Vendored AGNfitter-rX reference grids — keep crossvals CI-runnable (#613).
# Regenerate with: python scripts/build_<name>.py --download  (no AGNfitter install needed)
!data/agnfitter_bbb_reference.h5
!data/skirtor_mean3p_torus_grid.h5
!data/cat3d_wind_torus_grid.h5
!data/silva04_torus_grid.h5
!data/nenkova_agnfitter_torus_grid.h5
!data/dh02_ce01_grid.h5
# Fritz+2006 torus grid (#347/#804). Regenerate with:
#   python scripts/download_fritz2006_templates.py && python scripts/build_fritz2006_grid.py
!data/fritz2006_torus_grid.h5
!data/slone_netzer_disc_grid.h5
!data/wg00_attenuation_grid.h5
# wg00_attenuation_grid.h5 (~95 KB): regenerate with python scripts/build_wg00_grid.py --download
# Regenerate with: python scripts/convert_fsps_cloudy_grid.py && python scripts/convert_dl07_templates.py
# nthcomp_templates.h5 (~14 MB): regenerate with python scripts/build_nthcomp_templates.py

